    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>t</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>On differentiating, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>sec</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Again differentiating, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>sec</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>sec</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>When&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math>&nbsp;then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sec</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p>Then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>9</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math></p>"
  }
